result: "\"{\\\"viewport\\\":[1440,900],\\\"overflow\\\":false,\\\"flow\\\":\\\"How it works · read in orderDoctor and allocateCheck Node 24, PostgreSQL 18 or Python plus its locked validator; allocate a fresh UUID and private root.Own the instanceThe host owns a private control socket, loopback HTTP port, database and object directory; return PID plus process start identity and handle.Drive public behaviorPOST literal same-scope and other-scope commands; GET the committed journal and independently read its stored object bytes.Bind proofRecord exact head and source/configuration/skill digests, public observations, artifact size and hash; reject drift before reuse.Stop narrowlyAuthenticate the recorded live host and cleanup handle; remove its resources, never the retained evidence or another instance.\\\",\\\"animations\\\":0}\""
